stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> pending: interrupt() at approval_gate
    pending --> approved: approve
    pending --> revised: revise
    pending --> rejected: reject
    pending --> cancelled: cancel
    pending --> timed_out: timeout
    approved --> executed: save once
    revised --> executed: save once
    rejected --> [*]
    timed_out --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
    executed --> [*]
    note right of pending
        Checkpoint saved in PostgreSQL, stable decision_id issued.
        Refused, stays pending: unauthorized actor, invalid value,
        unknown id, invalid revision. Paused thread refuses new input.
    end note
    note left of executed
        Insert + executed=true in ONE transaction.
        A second run returns duplicate_prevented.
        A second decision is refused (already decided).
    end note
    note right of timed_out
        No decision within HITL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS:
        treated as reject, later decisions refused.
        Rejected / timed_out / cancelled save nothing.
    end note
